{:strongs 3595, :hebrew "כיור", :lang :zh-Hans, :gloss "properly, something round (as excavated or bored), i.e. a chafing-dish for coals or a caldron for cooking; hence (from similarity of form) a washbowl; also (for the same reason) a pulpit or platform", :text "本义为圆形之物（如挖凿或钻孔而成），即用于盛炭的火盆或用于烹饪的锅；由此（因形状相似）引申为洗濯盆；亦（基于同样原因）指讲台或平台。", :model "glm-5.2", :timestamp "2026-07-27T02:26:50.076187972Z"}